        "original_id": "6b2be108-4105-5b25-b290-a9e80215238e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lev Sedov, Leon Trotsky, Natalia Sedova\n- Organizations: Russian Social Democratic Labour Party, Communist Party\n- Roles: Russian Communist leader\n- Concepts: Menshevik Internationalists, Bolsheviks, October Revolution\n\nFacts:\n- Lev Sedov was born on 24 February 1906.\n- Lev Sedov was the son of Leon Trotsky and his second wife Natalia Sedova.\n- Leon Trotsky was a Russian Communist leader.\n- Leon Trotsky initially supported the Menshevik Internationalists faction within the Russian Social Democratic Labour Party.\n- Leon Trotsky joined the Bolsheviks just before the 1917 October Revolution.\n- Leon Trotsky immediately became a leader within the Communist Party after joining the Bolsheviks.\n- Lev Sedov died on 16 February 1938.",
